  metaTitle: "Wall Sconce Height Guide for Living Rooms",
  metaDescription: "How high to mount wall sconces in a living room: 60 to 66 inch centers, placement beside art or a TV, plug-in versus hardwired, and avoiding seated glare.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/sconce-above-tufted-chairs.webp",
